  "Shane": {
    "episodic_event": [
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Shane_f9bb4c70",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Shane",
        "content": "有个新来的农场主跟我搭话。我不认识他，为什么要跟我说话？我跟他说了句'我不认识你'就走开了。",
        "time": 2,
        "location": "Town",
        "importance": 0.3,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 2,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "first_meeting",
          "rude",
          "rejection"
        ]
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Shane_a6566d61",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Shane",
        "content": "玩家在JojaMart碰到我在上货。我头都没抬——你要买东西就去柜台，别跟我说话。我上班已经够烦了。",
        "time": 5,
        "location": "JojaMart",
        "importance": 0.35,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 5,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "work",
          "cold",
          "joja"
        ]
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Shane_9b03e0f7",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Shane",
        "content": "傍晚在牧场外面淋雨的时候被玩家看到了。我让他走开，但说实话……那一刻我其实有点不想一个人待着。",
        "time": 8,
        "location": "Forest",
        "importance": 0.5,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 8,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "rainy",
          "vulnerable",
          "depression"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": -0.5
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Shane_bca52f36",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Shane",
        "content": "这个农场主每天都来找我说话。真是够锲而不舍的。我今天终于跟他说了句'真没想到还有人愿意和我说话'——可能是真话。",
        "time": 14,
        "location": "Town",
        "importance": 0.6,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 14,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "persistence",
          "breakthrough",
          "surprise"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.2
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Shane_b54475ba",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Shane",
        "content": "玩家在酒馆请我喝了杯啤酒。我说'谢了……这比一个人喝强一点'。真的，强一点。",
        "time": 17,
        "location": "Saloon",
        "importance": 0.6,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 17,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "gift",
          "beer",
          "saloon"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.4
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Shane_5440223e",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Shane",
        "content": "我带玩家去看我的鸡了。给他介绍了查理——它是我最喜欢的一只。我跟他说'它们不会嫌我烦'。说这话的时候我居然笑了一下。",
        "time": 21,
        "location": "Forest",
        "importance": 0.7,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 21,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "chickens",
          "charlie",
          "passion"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.6
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Shane_d0491bcd",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Shane",
        "content": "在酒馆又喝多了。我居然对着玩家说了'有时候我觉得活着真累……你为什么要一直来找我？难道你不觉得我很烦吗？'第二天醒来后悔死了。",
        "time": 24,
        "location": "Saloon",
        "importance": 0.75,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 24,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "drunk",
          "vulnerable",
          "depression"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": -0.7
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Shane_f2924c46",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Shane",
        "content": "昨晚又喝醉了。但玩家没有走，陪我坐到了酒馆打烊。第二天我跟他说'昨晚的事别跟别人说'——其实我想说谢谢。",
        "time": 25,
        "location": "Saloon",
        "importance": 0.8,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 25,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "support",
          "trust",
          "vulnerable"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.3
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Shane_9a2b3c98",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Shane",
        "content": "我对玩家说'我戒酒了——大概吧。至少今天没喝'。说出口的那一刻，我自己都信了。也许我真的可以做到。",
        "time": 30,
        "location": "Forest",
        "importance": 0.8,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 30,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "sobriety",
          "growth",
          "effort"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.5
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Shane_115cf18a",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Shane",
        "content": "我跟玩家说了'如果你是认真的，那我就是全世界最幸运的人'。然后立刻转移话题说鸡舍要打扫了——我怕他看出我说的每个字都是认真的。",
        "time": 35,
        "location": "Farm",
        "importance": 0.85,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 35,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "romance",
          "awkward",
          "gratitude"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Shane_f09485e7",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Shane",
        "content": "下雨天和玩家待在家里。我跟他说'雨天在家……有你在就好。我以前从来不敢想这种生活'。说完觉得鼻子有点酸。",
        "time": 40,
        "location": "Farm",
        "importance": 0.8,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 40,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "rainy",
          "domestic",
          "gratitude"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.8
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Shane_8323b576",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Shane",
        "content": "早上给玩家泡了咖啡，什么都没说就放在他旁边。'……早。'——这是我表达关心的方式。他应该懂吧。",
        "time": 42,
        "location": "Farm",
        "importance": 0.7,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 42,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "morning",
          "coffee",
          "care"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.7
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Shane_324477fd",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Shane",
        "content": "玩家说'你这样喝下去会死的'。我当时就炸了——我说'我的命我自己管，用不着你操心'。然后灌了更多。后来想想他说得对，但当时听到这句话只想把人推开。",
        "time": 22,
        "location": "Saloon",
        "importance": 0.7,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 22,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "drunk",
          "conflict",
          "defensive",
          "alcohol"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": -0.7
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Shane_7878969b",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Shane",
        "content": "玩家在JojaMart当着经理的面问我是不是最近状态不好。我吼了句'你能不能别管我'。下班以后觉得有点后悔——他可能只是出于好意，但我不需要全世界都知道我有问题。",
        "time": 7,
        "location": "JojaMart",
        "importance": 0.55,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 7,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "work",
          "conflict",
          "public",
          "pride"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": -0.4
      }
    ],
