  "Sebastian": {
    "episodic_event": [
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Sebastian_a4cdd0c0",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Sebastian",
        "content": "新来的农场主闯进地下室找我说话。我头都没抬——那么多地方你不选，偏偏选中鹈鹕镇？行吧。",
        "time": 1,
        "location": "Mountain",
        "importance": 0.3,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 1,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "first_meeting",
          "skeptical"
        ]
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Sebastian_e76b094a",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Sebastian",
        "content": "雨天的山上碰到了玩家。我说了句'运气好的话，这种天气可能会看见青蛙'。比平时说的话多了一点——大概是下雨让人放松。",
        "time": 5,
        "location": "Mountain",
        "importance": 0.45,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 5,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "rainy",
          "frogs",
          "nature"
        ]
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Sebastian_45189a40",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Sebastian",
        "content": "晚上在湖边抽烟的时候玩家过来了。我跟他说'我通常只有天黑后才出去'——然后问他觉不觉得奇怪。他说不觉得。",
        "time": 9,
        "location": "Mountain",
        "importance": 0.5,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 9,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "night",
          "smoking",
          "loner"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.1
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Sebastian_b4fc4479",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Sebastian",
        "content": "我不小心问出口了——'要是我突然消失，会有人挂念我吗？'说出口就后悔了。这种问题不应该问别人。",
        "time": 14,
        "location": "Mountain",
        "importance": 0.65,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 14,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "existential",
          "vulnerable",
          "loneliness"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": -0.3
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Sebastian_5f5b3117",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Sebastian",
        "content": "和山姆在酒馆打台球的时候玩家也在。打台球的时候我比平时放松，可能还笑了一下——山姆有这种效果。",
        "time": 17,
        "location": "Saloon",
        "importance": 0.55,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 17,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "friends",
          "sam",
          "pool"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.4
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Sebastian_2cf5b7de",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Sebastian",
        "content": "我跟玩家吐槽了玛鲁。我说大家都喜欢她不过是因为她会吸引注意力——说完立刻道歉了。其实我知道这不公平，玛鲁没那么坏。但有时候就是忍不住。",
        "time": 20,
        "location": "Mountain",
        "importance": 0.65,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 20,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "family",
          "maru",
          "jealousy",
          "honest"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": -0.2
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Sebastian_faf29f87",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Sebastian",
        "content": "雨天的海滩只有我和玩家。我对着远处的海平线说了一堆平时不会说的话——'遥望天水一线的苍茫让我有动力继续向前走'。他听完什么都没说，但我知道他懂了。",
        "time": 24,
        "location": "Beach",
        "importance": 0.75,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 24,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "rainy",
          "beach",
          "deep_talk",
          "motivation"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.5
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Sebastian_8f569c6c",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Sebastian",
        "content": "我对玩家说了实话：'你跟山姆是我在这镇上唯一的朋友'。说完我立刻低头看手机——说这种话太不像我了。",
        "time": 28,
        "location": "Mountain",
        "importance": 0.75,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 28,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "friendship",
          "gratitude",
          "rare_admission"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.7
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Sebastian_61f0c7ae",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Sebastian",
        "content": "夜里看着满身是泥的玩家，我居然说了一句'你一直看起来很棒，即使在院子里弄得满身都是泥之后'。好吧，这就是我的情话水平。",
        "time": 33,
        "location": "Farm",
        "importance": 0.8,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 33,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "romance",
          "compliment",
          "night"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.8
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Sebastian_a66b7904",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Sebastian",
        "content": "我认真地跟玩家说'我在尽最大努力戒烟……我不想比你先去世。这是个坏习惯。我想和你共创未来'。我以前从来不会想'未来'这种事的。",
        "time": 38,
        "location": "Farm",
        "importance": 0.85,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 38,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "growth",
          "smoking",
          "future",
          "love"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Sebastian_8bc0d7af",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Sebastian",
        "content": "被噩梦惊醒后睡不着，给玩家煮了咖啡。他问我还好吗，我说了实话——'从噩梦中醒来，再也睡不着了'。在他面前说这些好像没那么难。",
        "time": 41,
        "location": "Farm",
        "importance": 0.7,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 41,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "morning",
          "coffee",
          "nightmare",
          "care"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.6
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Sebastian_c409300a",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Sebastian",
        "content": "冬夜跟玩家说'和你住在这里让我学会了走出自己的堡垒。我觉得这样对我很好'。说这种话还是有点不好意思，但他在笑，所以应该值得。",
        "time": 44,
        "location": "Farm",
        "importance": 0.8,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 44,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "winter",
          "growth",
          "gratitude"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.8
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Sebastian_27a1ffd9",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Sebastian",
        "content": "玩家一直问我为什么不搬出地下室。我说'你知道什么？不是所有人都像你一样想怎样就怎样'。语气可能太重了，但有时候被追问的感觉真的很窒息。",
        "time": 30,
        "location": "Mountain",
        "importance": 0.6,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 30,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "conflict",
          "pressure",
          "defensive",
          "basement"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": -0.5
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Sebastian_e330069c",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Sebastian",
        "content": "有人又拿我和玛鲁比了——'你姐姐那么优秀，你怎么就不能学学'。我对玩家说'如果你也觉得我只是个不合群的怪人，那就直说'。我不想被比较，从来都不想。",
        "time": 25,
        "location": "Mountain",
        "importance": 0.65,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 25,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "family",
          "maru",
          "conflict",
          "comparison",
          "jealousy"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": -0.6
      }
    ],
