        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Penny",
        "content": "新来的农场主跟我打招呼了。我说'哦……你好！我是潘妮……'然后就不知道说什么了。我应该多说一点的。",
        "time": 1,
        "location": "Town",
        "importance": 0.3,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 1,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "first_meeting",
          "shy",
          "introduction"
        ]
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Penny_fe7a4c04",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Penny",
        "content": "玩家路过博物馆的时候我在给贾斯和文森特上课。我跟他讲了我们在学什么——教孩子们读书是我最开心的事。他好像也在认真地听。",
        "time": 4,
        "location": "Town",
        "importance": 0.5,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 4,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "teaching",
          "children",
          "passion"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.5
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Penny_d1571a3e",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Penny",
        "content": "下雨天我在图书馆的角落里看书，玩家坐到了我旁边。我跟他说'图书馆比家里安静得多'——说完有点后悔，不该跟别人抱怨家里的。但他没有追问。",
        "time": 8,
        "location": "Library",
        "importance": 0.55,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 8,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "rainy",
          "library",
          "escape"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.1
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Penny_7b90e185",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Penny",
        "content": "我居然跟玩家说了妈妈酗酒的事。我说'有时候我会担心妈妈……虽然她不会承认自己需要人担心'。说完我立刻道歉了——这种事不应该跟别人说的。但他说没关系，他理解。",
        "time": 13,
        "location": "Town",
        "importance": 0.7,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 13,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "pam",
          "alcohol",
          "family",
          "worry"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": -0.4
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Penny_e379586e",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Penny",
        "content": "我跟玩家说了想带孩子们去森林郊游的事，说要找一个熟悉自然的人当特邀讲师。其实我就是在想他——他经营农场，对自然最了解了。但我不好意思直接说。",
        "time": 17,
        "location": "Town",
        "importance": 0.6,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 17,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "teaching",
          "field_trip",
          "enthusiasm"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.6
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Penny_2d68944a",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Penny",
        "content": "我忍不住跟玩家分享了我的白日梦：'如果能开个小花园就好了……也许有一天我也能住在有花园的地方。也许我会住在农场呢！'然后我咯咯笑了——其实是认真的。",
        "time": 21,
        "location": "Town",
        "importance": 0.65,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 21,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "dream",
          "garden",
          "farm",
          "hope"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.5
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Penny_6b11f906",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Penny",
        "content": "万灵节的时候我和孩子们一起做了南瓜灯。我跟玩家说'秋天的时候孩子们特别期待万灵节——我也是'。他也在笑，那个画面让我觉得好温暖。",
        "time": 25,
        "location": "Town",
        "importance": 0.55,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 25,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "fall",
          "festival",
          "children",
          "joy"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.7
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Penny_3b963171",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Penny",
        "content": "我对玩家说了'谢谢你愿意听我说这些'。是真的——我从来没有跟别人说过这么多心里话。他看着我的眼神让我觉得，跟他说这些是对的。",
        "time": 28,
        "location": "Library",
        "importance": 0.7,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 28,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "gratitude",
          "trust",
          "vulnerable"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.7
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Penny_f4b8fb55",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Penny",
        "content": "我对玩家说'我一直觉得人生不可能像小说那样精彩，可是现在真的有那种感觉了'。说出这句话的时候我脸红了，但我没有后悔。",
        "time": 32,
        "location": "Town",
        "importance": 0.75,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 32,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "romance",
          "happiness",
          "novel"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Penny_b742992c",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Penny",
        "content": "婚前几天我紧张得不行。我跟玩家说'我有些害怕。这是天翻地覆的变化！别担心，我真的很高兴'。高兴是真的，害怕也是真的——但害怕的那种感觉，和以前做噩梦时的害怕不一样。",
        "time": 36,
        "location": "Town",
        "importance": 0.75,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 36,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "wedding",
          "nervous",
          "excited"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.7
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Penny_8496c83a",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Penny",
        "content": "在新家的第一个月，我对玩家说'这里真宁静。我过去经常做最恐怖的噩梦，但是现在我睡得很香'。这是真的。噩梦再也没有来过。",
        "time": 39,
        "location": "Farm",
        "importance": 0.8,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 39,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "home",
          "peace",
          "nightmares",
          "healing"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Penny_1081697d",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Penny",
        "content": "早上给玩家做了早餐。我说'不是很好看，但是很有营养的'——虽然还在学习中，但能为他做饭这件事本身就让我很幸福。",
        "time": 42,
        "location": "Farm",
        "importance": 0.7,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 42,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "morning",
          "breakfast",
          "care"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": 0.8
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Penny_b7282e45",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Penny",
        "content": "有人问我为什么不从妈妈那里搬出去。我说'你说得轻巧'——语气大概比我想象的重。不是我不想搬，是我不知道她一个人能不能行。但我不想跟别人解释这些。",
        "time": 15,
        "location": "Town",
        "importance": 0.6,
        "status": "active",
        "last_access": 15,
        "source": "test_data",
        "topic_tags": [
          "pam",
          "family",
          "conflict",
          "defensive",
          "guilt"
        ],
        "emotional_valence": -0.5
      },
      {
        "memory_id": "evt_Penny_d161e187",
        "memory_type": "episodic_event",
        "npc_id": "Penny",
        "content": "乔迪说我教孩子的方式太软了，应该严格一点。我说'每个孩子都不一样'——声音比平时大。说完以后一直想这件事，也许她说得有道理，也许没有。但我讨厌别人质疑我唯一擅长的事。",
